===Etymology===
From {{inh|en|enm|abominacioun}}, from {{der|en|frm|abomination|t=horror, disgust}}, from {{der|en|LL.|abōminātiō|abōminātiō, abōminātiōnem|t=abomination}}<ref>{{R:CDOE|page=4}}</ref> {{dbt|en|abominatio}}.

